      "source": "Customize query for <a href=\"#sliceResult(java.util.List,org.springframework.data.domain.Pageable)\"><code>sliced result</code></a> retrieval. If <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#isPaged()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>paged</code></a> the\n<a href=\"../../core/query/Query.html#limit(int)\"><code>limit</code></a> is set to <code>pagesize + 1</code> in order to determine if more data is available.",
      "translation": "自定义用于检索<a href=\"#sliceResult(java.util.List,org.springframework.data.domain.Pageable)\"><code>sliced result</code></a>的查询。如果<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#isPaged()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>paged</code></a>为真，则\n将<a href=\"../../core/query/Query.html#limit(int)\"><code>limit</code></a>设置为<code>pagesize + 1</code>，以确定是否还有更多数据。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Utility methods for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Slice.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> handling.",
      "translation": "用于处理<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Slice.html\" title=\"类或接口位于 org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>的实用方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Customize query for <a href=\"#sliceResult(java.util.List,org.springframework.data.domain.Pageable)\"><code>sliced result</code></a> retrieval.",
      "translation": "自定义查询以检索<a href=\"#sliceResult(java.util.List,org.springframework.data.domain.Pageable)\"><code>切片结果</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "new instance of <a href=\"../../core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> if either <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#isPaged()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>paged</code></a>, the source query otherwise.",
      "translation": "如果 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#isPaged()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>paged</code></a> 为 true，则返回一个新的 <a href=\"../../core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> 实例；否则返回源查询。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>resultList</code> - the source list holding the result of the request. If the result list contains more elements\n         (indicating a next slice is available) it is trimmed to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#getPageSize()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>page size</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>resultList</code> - 存放请求结果的源列表。如果结果列表包含更多元素（表示还有下一片数据），则将其修剪至 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#getPageSize()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>page size</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
